  "releaseNotes": "1.2.2: Package-only fix. The 1.2.1 nuspec declared CoreSystem.Observability.Abstractions 1.0.0 because the package was tagged before the central pin was refreshed. This release declares 1.0.1. No code or API changes.\n\t\t\t1.2.3: Dependency refresh (OpenTelemetry.Extensions.Hosting 1.19.0 to 1.20.0; CoreSystem.Observability.Abstractions refreshed to 1.0.2, which brings Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks 8.0.32) plus package metadata fix: ships the LICENSE file and declares PackageLicenseFile. Every other CoreSystem package did already; this one was the only package published without a license. No code or API changes.\n\t\t\t1.3.0: Targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. No public API or code change; the net9.0 and net10.0 assets are new. Dependency refresh on every TFM: OpenTelemetry, OpenTelemetry.Api and OpenTelemetry.Extensions.Hosting 1.20.0 to 1.20.1; CoreSystem.Observability.Abstractions 1.0.2 to 1.1.0.",
